{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16012","headline":"织锦曲 · 王建","name":"织锦曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大女身爲织锦户，名在县家供进簿。\n长头起样呈作官，闻道官家中苦难。\n回花侧叶与人别，唯恐秋天丝线乾。\n红缕葳蕤紫茸软，蝶飞参差花宛转。\n一梭声尽重一梭，玉腕不停罗袖卷。\n窗中夜久睡髻偏，横钗欲堕垂着肩。\n合衣卧时参没後，停灯起在鸡鸣前。\n一匹千金亦不卖，限日未成宫里怪。\n锦江水涸贡转多，宫中尽着单丝罗。\n莫言山积无尽日，百丈高楼一曲歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}